WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,040
Uncle Ai picked it all up

2
00:00:01,040 --> 00:00:02,280
Xiaomian even fell down once

3
00:00:02,280 --> 00:00:03,640
It’s useless even if you fall.

4
00:00:03,640 --> 00:00:04,760
Waste is waste

5
00:00:04,760 --> 00:00:06,160
Contributed the least for several days in a row

6
00:00:06,160 --> 00:00:07,800
Why halve dinner?

7
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:09,600
The food is what we found

8
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:11,080
I also ordered it by fire.

9
00:00:11,080 --> 00:00:14,280
I think it's ok if I divide it evenly. I'll give you the crabs to eat raw.

10
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:15,560
It’s not you who lost the firewood

11
00:00:15,560 --> 00:00:18,320
Aren't you just holding Su Che's lighter? What's wrong?

12
00:00:18,320 --> 00:00:19,760
If you have the ability, go and get it.

13
00:00:19,760 --> 00:00:21,720
Don't blame others if you don't have the ability.

14
00:00:21,720 --> 00:00:23,120
Su Che himself didn't even come to ask for it from me.

15
00:00:23,120 --> 00:00:24,280
You screamed for him

16
00:00:24,280 --> 00:00:25,400
Have the ability

17
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:29,280
You call Su Che over. That's enough. Stop saying a few words during the meal. I told you earlier.

18
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:30,680
Without a man, it will still be fruitful

19
00:00:30,680 --> 00:00:33,040
Su Che was lucky the past two days, maybe today

20
00:00:33,040 --> 00:00:35,920
He is so hungry that his chest is touching his back, waiting for him to smell the aroma of our roasted shoes.

21
00:00:35,920 --> 00:00:36,960
Will you come back?

22
00:00:36,960 --> 00:00:40,080
It's okay to come back. I apologize in advance. I see we are eating so well now.

23
00:00:40,080 --> 00:00:41,560
Look at him, he has to kneel down and beg us
